# --- Image attachments accidentally embedded in notebooks ----------------
# (See Phase 7 QA — Jupyter occasionally embeds dragged-in images as
# multi-MB base64 attachments. The booklet's images live in
# Image\ assetss\ for\ OCAIH\ booklet\ 2026/ and are referenced by relative
# path. If you find a notebook bloating in size after editing, search for
# "attachments": and remove that key from the JSON.)
